OL,3,AMahmood refuses to put cost on care
OL,4,Aworker settlement climbdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile not detailing the cost of the
OL,7,Frevised plans, Mahmood told the BBC
OL,8,Fthey would still save "billions"
OL,9,Fbecause workers in other sectors would
OL,10,Fhave to wait longer.
